    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29749" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δωδεκᾰταῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>on the twelfth day, in twelve days</i>, 
