				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					614b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				7.1.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυωδεκαταῖος ἀφ᾽ ὧτέ νιν οὐδὲ
